SUMMARY:Fall Harvest Festival
DESCRIPTION:Fall Harvest Festival\nJoin us in the Parish House for a festive afternoon celebrating all things fall! We’ll gather for a fun-filled Fall Harvest Festival for all ages. \nWe’ll have lunch together\, plus pumpkin painting\, delicious fall treats and games and activities for the whole family. Sign up here to bring a dish or other item to share\, or simply sign up to let us know you’re coming! \nWhether you’re little or big\, you’ll find something to enjoy as we celebrate the beauty\, joy and abundance of the fall season together.
URL:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/event/fall-harvest-festival/
LOCATION:Saint James Parish House Forum Room\, 119 North Duke Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FEATURED-IMG-Fall-Harvest-Festival-copy.jpg
